// DataBridge Error Codes
// ======================
// Format: DXXX - Description - Explanation
// Groups: 00x (Provider), 01x (Connection), 02x (Driver), 03x (Query), 04x (Schema), 05x (Model), 06x (Transaction)

// ===== Provider Errors (00x) =====
// Errors related to database provider configuration and connection

D001 - Provider not specified - The database provider was not specified in the connection configuration
D002 - Invalid provider - The specified provider is not a valid option for DataBridge
D003 - Provider not supported - The provider is not currently supported by DataBridge
D004 - Provider configuration missing - Required configuration options for the provider are missing
D005 - Provider connection failed - Failed to establish a connection with the database provider
D006 - Provider error - General provider error

// ===== Connection Errors (01x) =====
// Errors related to database connection management

D010 - Connection timeout - The connection attempt exceeded the timeout limit
D011 - Connection refused - The database server refused the connection
D012 - Connection closed - The connection was unexpectedly closed or terminated
D013 - Invalid connection URL - The connection URL format is invalid or malformed
D014 - SSL/TLS error - SSL/TLS handshake failed or certificate validation error
D015 - No Connection error - There is no connection established
D016 - Connection Error - General Connection Error

// ===== Driver Errors (02x) =====
// Errors related to database driver operations

D020 - Driver not found - The required database driver could not be located
D021 - Driver initialization failed - Failed to initialize the database driver
D022 - Driver incompatible - The driver is not compatible with the current DataBridge version
D023 - Driver version mismatch - The driver version does not match the required version
D024 - Driver URL missing - The connection URL is missing or empty
D025 - Driver Error - General Driver Error

// ===== Query Errors (03x) =====
// Errors related to query building and execution

D030 - Invalid query syntax - The query syntax is invalid or malformed
D031 - Query execution failed - The query execution failed due to an error
D032 - Query timeout - The query execution exceeded the timeout limit
D033 - Invalid query parameter - A parameter provided for the query is invalid
D034 - Query result empty - The query returned no results

// ===== Schema Errors (04x) =====
// Errors related to schema definition and validation

D040 - Invalid schema definition - The schema definition is invalid or malformed
D041 - Schema validation failed - The schema validation failed due to errors
D042 - Schema migration failed - The schema migration process failed
D043 - Schema already exists - The schema already exists in the database
D044 - Schema not found - The schema could not be found in the database

// ===== Model Errors (05x) =====
// Errors related to model operations

D050 - Model not found - The model could not be found
D051 - Model already exists - The model already exists in the database
D052 - Invalid model definition - The model definition is invalid or malformed
D053 - Model validation failed - The model validation failed due to errors
D054 - Model creation failed - Failed to create the model

// ===== Transaction Errors (06x) =====
// Errors related to transaction management

D060 - Transaction failed - The transaction failed to complete
D061 - Transaction timeout - The transaction exceeded the timeout limit
D062 - Transaction already started - A transaction is already in progress
D063 - Transaction not started - No transaction has been started